<title>FRANCE: Paribas makes gain from Allianz Via sale.</title>
<headline>Paribas makes gain from Allianz Via sale.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>French financial holding company Cie Financiere de Paribas said on Thursday it would make a capital gain of about 700 million francs from its sale of 34.4 percent of Allianz Via Holding France to German insurance giant Allianz AG Holding.</p>
<p>Paribas holds the stake in Allianz Via Holding France through its Cie de Navigation Mixte unit. The stake was valued on Paribas' books at 1.5 billion francs and it sold the stake for 2.2 billion.</p>
<p>Paribas took over Navigation Mixte through a public offer launched in March 1996.</p>
</text>
